            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sickle cell disease is one of the most common global genetic disorders. It is a debilitating condition and children with sickle cell disease are more likely to have a stroke, and experience lower quality of life and shorter life expectancy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
